        "boss.se": "# The Boss: one big brain with three phases. Its stats are its memory: the hitbox says which phase it is in.\nbend weave\nwhen spawn {\n  ((hitbox 140%))\n  ((regen hp 1.5))\n  say \"I am the Boss. Run.\"\n  attack nearest duck\n}\nevery 2s [attack 75%, flee 25%]\nwhen hit {\n  let way = 1:3\n  \\if way == 1\\ \\move\\{ >4 /\\3 } else \\if way == 2\\ \\move\\{ <4 \\/3 } else \\move\\{ >3 \\/4 }\n  \\if hppct < 25 and hitbox < 200\\ {\n    ((hitbox 200%))\n    ((speed 2))\n    say \"ENOUGH! Now you see my true size!\"\n    attack nearest duck\n  } else \\if hppct < 50 and hitbox < 170\\ {\n    ((hitbox 170%))\n    ((speed 1.5))\n    say \"You hurt me. I am bigger than that.\"\n    attack nearest duck\n  }\n}\nwhen dead say \"No... you ducks...\"\n",
        "lava.se": "# The Boss's floor: three squares of fire jump around the arena every few seconds.\nsquares 3\nsize 10\norder random\nevery 4s step\nwhen enter step\n"
